sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User (Browser)
  participant CP as apps/app (Next.js)
  participant SB as Supabase Auth (GoTrue)
  participant CJ as Cookie Jar (sb-* cookies)

  U->>CP: GET /(authenticated)/*
  CP->>SB: auth.getSession() via server client (cookies)
  SB-->>CP: session = null
  CP-->>U: 302 Redirect /login

  U->>SB: signInWithPassword(email, password)
  SB-->>U: session + refresh token
  U->>CJ: store/update cookies (via @supabase/ssr)
  U->>CP: GET /(authenticated)/* with cookies
  CP->>SB: auth.getSession() via server client (cookies)
  SB-->>CP: session + user
  CP-->>U: 200 Render protected page

  U->>SB: signInWithOAuth(provider, redirectTo=/api/auth/callback?next=/)
  SB-->>U: 302 Redirect to provider
  U->>CP: GET /api/auth/callback?code=...&next=/
  CP->>SB: auth.exchangeCodeForSession(code)
  SB-->>CP: set cookie tokens
  CP->>CJ: Set-Cookie (sb-* cookies)
  CP-->>U: 302 Redirect safe next

  Note over CP: Protected routes use authMiddleware + getServerSession
  Note over CP: Authorization uses withRBAC(resource, action)

